        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Patchouli's been holed up in that dusty old library of hers for quite a while, huh? </i><br> <i>Think I oughta check on her again...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>東方恋物語 ~ Locked Together </i>is a PC-98 style Touhou Project fangame featuring an extra-length stage and boss with 10 spells, a chain based scoring system, and some other luxuries not afforded by the original PC-98 Touhou games. The difficulty is punishing, but remains accessible through options to tune your own experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Today must be one of her good days...&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patchouli's no slouch, and it seems today is one of her good days. Survive a full length stage and 10 original spell cards to drag her out of that dusty old library before she turns into dust herself! Master a graze chaining score system inspired by Subterranean Animism and Shuusou Gyoku to obtain ludicrous scores! Practice with efficiency using the Grimoire of Marisa to find your best chance at survival, and record your best achievements by saving your replays to show off to your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're a shmup enthusiast, go for that 1cc!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Patchouli's been holed up in that dusty old library of hers for quite a while, huh? </i><br> <i>Think I oughta check on her again...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>東方恋物語 ~ Locked Together </i>is a PC-98 style Touhou Project fangame featuring an extra-length stage and boss with 10 spells, a chain based scoring system, and some other luxuries not afforded by the original PC-98 Touhou games. The difficulty is punishing, but remains accessible through options to tune your own experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Today must be one of her good days...&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patchouli's no slouch, and it seems today is one of her good days. Survive a full length stage and 10 original spell cards to drag her out of that dusty old library before she turns into dust herself! Master a graze chaining score system inspired by Subterranean Animism and Shuusou Gyoku to obtain ludicrous scores! Practice with efficiency using the Grimoire of Marisa to find your best chance at survival, and record your best achievements by saving your replays to show off to your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're a shmup enthusiast, go for that 1cc!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
